    "updated_at": "2023-03-27T17:39:03Z",
    "body": "Both\r\n```\r\n[directory]\r\ntruncation_symbol = \"\\ue5ff/\"\r\n```\r\nand\r\n```\r\n[directory]\r\ntruncation_symbol = \"\\ue5ff\\\\\"\r\n```\r\nturn `~/a/nested/path` into `\\a\\nested\\path` on windows. `/` is also autoconverted in `home_symbol` and `substitutions`. But neither in `read_only`, `format` nor `repo_root_format`.\r\n",
